perf-results.json
docs/perf-app-screenshot.png

# Generic build-output guard. Nothing in the tree writes here today — this
# project has no build step. The reason recorded for it was
# `build_engine_artifact.py --out dist/`, and it sat beside
# /engine.bundle.js and /engine.manifest.json, the pinned release artifact
# `apply_engine.py` downloaded. Those three scripts and both files left at
# R2.1 with the engine release channel (docs/ENGINE_SYNC.md), so the two
# ignores went with them on 2026-09-12; dist/ is kept as a plain guard.
dist/
